<title>JAPAN: Hachijuni Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hachijuni Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    90.35		vs	  107.89</p>
<p> Operating	   21.75		vs	   20.29</p>
<p> Current	     10.84		vs	   15.39</p>
<p> Net		    6.83		vs	    6.77</p>
<p> EPS		   11.92 yen	  vs	   11.82 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    574 million	  vs	 573 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hachijuni Bank Ltd is a Nagano-based regional bank.</p>
</text>
